                                                "sense_id": "5cd1b1b1-2b98-3460-8dfe-d2f14bb674b0",
                                                "text": "The light-chestnut soils are much more detrital than the chestnut varieties — not only at the surface but throughout the soil strata, except on sandy tracts."
